   {
    "id": "i2",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     29,
     45
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Unit test suite for {@link ZippingIterator}. <p> A {@link ZippingIterator} interleaves the elements of its child iterators in round-robin order, so a tour over {@code [A, B, C]} yields {@code A0, B0, C0, A1, B1, C1, ...}. When a child runs out of elements it is dropped and the remaining children keep being interleaved. </p> <p> The tests share three fixtures built in {@link #setUp()}: </p> <ul> <li>{@link #evens} = {@code [0, 2, 4, ..., 18]} (10 elements)</li> <li>{@link #odds} = {@code [1, 3, 5, ..., 19]} (10 elements)</li> <li>{@link #fib} = {@code [1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, 21]} (8 elements)</li> </ul>"
   },
   {
    "id": "i3",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     49,
     49
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Even numbers in {@code [0, 20)}: {@code [0, 2, 4, ..., 18]}."
   },
   {
    "id": "i4",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     52,
     52
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Odd numbers in {@code [0, 20)}: {@code [1, 3, 5, ..., 19]}."
   },
   {
    "id": "i5",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     55,
     55
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "The first eight Fibonacci numbers: {@code [1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, 21]}."
   },
   {
    "id": "i6",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     91,
     93
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Zipping a single iterator simply replays that iterator unchanged."
   },
   {
    "id": "i7",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     105,
     108
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Zipping the same iterator twice yields each even number repeated back to back: {@code [0, 0, 2, 2, 4, 4, ...]}."
   },
   {
    "id": "i8",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     121,
     124
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Interleaving evens with odds reproduces the natural order {@code [0, 1, 2, 3, ..., 19]}."
   },
   {
    "id": "i9",
    "kind": "Javadoc",
    "lines": [
     135,
     140
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Interleaves three iterators of differing lengths. Once {@link #fib} (the shortest, 8 elements) is exhausted, the round-robin continues over just {@link #evens} and {@link #odds} until they too run out. Each expected value is annotated with the child it comes from."
   },
